# Control for Shadowspear's "lose indestructible": the same Lightning Bolt at Bot2's Ornithopter wearing Hammer of Nazahn
# (+2/+0, indestructible) without Shadowspear's ability activated. The 3 damage is lethal on the 2/2 but indestructible
# keeps it (CR 702.12b), so it stays on the battlefield with the damage marked.

